<title>UK: Bradford &amp; Bingley B/S sets 200 mln stg FRN.</title>
<headline>Bradford &amp; Bingley B/S sets 200 mln stg FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following funglible floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and NatWest Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BRADFORD AND BINGLEY B/S</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   SPREAD     5 BP	MATURITY    *  NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE ** 26.SEP.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.85     FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES    * CALL IN NOVEMBER 2000 AT PAR</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS 50 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  8 BP	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
